{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532233/", "pk": 532233, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/", "pk": 110654, "shortname": "sixfinscharter", "name": "Six Fins Boat Charter - Perry Marina", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Private Dolphin Playground Safari", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 9, "unicode": "Private Dolphin Playground Safari", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 1764, "description": "#Prepare for the encounter of a lifetime as we set sail on a Dolphin Charter in Key West. \n\n##About\nCruise along the shimmering waters, where these majestic creatures playfully dance in their natural habitat. Feel the thrill as pods of dolphins gracefully leap and frolic alongside our boat, providing a spectacle that's as heartwarming as it is exhilarating. Our expert crew will share fascinating insights into dolphin behavior, ensuring an educational and awe-inspiring experience for all ages. Don't miss this opportunity to create cherished memories and forge a deeper connection with the wonders of the sea.\n\n##Complimentary\nAll charter passengers may use The Perry Hotel and Marina pools & gym as my guests before and after the charter. David, Owner", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Key West, Fl.", "booking_notes": "IMPORTANT ACTION REQUIRED\nSix Fins Charter – Dolphin Safari Confirmation\n\nDear Guests,\n\nWe’re excited to welcome you aboard your Private Dolphin Safari — a 3-hour wildlife experience in the calm waters surrounding Key West.\n\nPlease review the important details below to ensure a smooth and memorable encounter.\n\n✅ Before Your Charter\n\nFor trips up to six passengers:\n\n👉 Complete the insurance waiver:[here] (https://waiver.smartwaiver.com/w/rd9k5tiavpwper7h2rhaqh/web/)\n\nAND for trips with 7th and 8th passengers:\n\n👉 The primary renter (21+ years old) and captain must complete the Bareboat Agreement together at the dock before departure, but prior to arrival, you may begin: [here](https://waiver.smartwaiver.com/w/ez5636zbxexwrng7dtz6mq/web/)\n\nAll required forms must be completed prior to arrival.\n\n🐬 Your Dolphin Experience\n\nThis private safari explores known dolphin habitats in the Gulf and backcountry waters.\n\nWhile dolphin sightings are common, they are wild animals and cannot be guaranteed. Every encounter is unique and conducted with respectful wildlife viewing practices.\n\nYou may also see sea turtles, rays, and migratory birds.\n\n📍 Departure Details\n\nDock A, Slip #32\n7001 Shrimp Rd\nStock Island, FL 33040\n\nPlease arrive 15 minutes prior to departure.\n\n🩺 Health & Safety\n\nThis is generally a calm-water cruise.\n\nGuests should be comfortable boarding and riding on a vessel.\n\nThe captain may adjust route based on weather or wildlife movement.\n\n• Food allergies or dietary restrictions: reply to this email and let us know in advance so we can prepare.\n• Prone to seasickness: tell us ahead of time and we'll suggest what to take before boarding.\n\n🎁 Complimentary Access\n\nAs my charter guests, you may enjoy access to The Perry Hotel & Marina pools and fitness center before and after your charter.\n\nWe look forward to sharing a truly special wildlife experience with you.\n\nBest regards,\nDavid McFadden\nOwner, Six Fins Charter", "cancellation_notes": "Enjoy peace of mind with our cancellation policy:\n\nAll reservations made within 7 calendar days of departure are non-refundable. Customer cancellations made prior to 7 calendar days before departure will receive a full refund. If Six Fins Charter cancels due to unsafe weather conditions or other circumstances initiated by the owner/operator, the customer will receive a full refund.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Wild Atlantic dolphins on their own time", "short_description": "", "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532233/images/1228534/", "pk": 1228534, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6auNpiXIQrCxnQM9DV1R", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6auNpiXIQrCxnQM9DV1R", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532233/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6auNpiXIQrCxnQM9DV1R", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6auNpiXIQrCxnQM9DV1R", "is_low_resolution": true, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532233/images/1228537/", "pk": 1228537, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kIAz9SGbQsalnlGlNbd7", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kIAz9SGbQsalnlGlNbd7", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/sixfinscharter/items/532233/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kIAz9SGbQsalnlGlN